{"term":{"label":"禮","occurrences":8,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i","title":"離婁上","description":"孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"上","id":"上"},{"form":"二","id":"二"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"實","id":"實"},{"form":"居","id":"居"},{"form":"師","id":"師"},{"form":"文","id":"文"},{"form":"斯","id":"斯"},{"form":"既","id":"既"},{"form":"樂","id":"樂"},{"form":"濯","id":"濯"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"由","id":"由"},{"form":"禮","id":"禮"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"言","id":"言"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.6936614636501104,"source":"二","target":"斯"},{"weight":2.8759830204440653,"source":"二","target":"實"},{"weight":1.5950491749820008,"source":"二","target":"文"},{"weight":2.000514283090165,"source":"二","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.2881963555419462,"source":"二","target":"樂"},{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"人","target":"既"},{"weight":0.8109302162163288,"source":"人","target":"禮"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"source":"人","target":"言"},{"weight":0.4054651081081644,"source":"人","target":"義"},{"weight":0.5877866649021191,"source":"人","target":"師"},{"weight":2.847812143477369,"source":"斯","target":"濯"},{"weight":2.7424516278195425,"source":"斯","target":"實"},{"weight":1.461517782357478,"source":"斯","target":"文"},{"weight":1.8669828904656425,"source":"斯","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.1546649629174235,"source":"斯","target":"樂"},{"weight":2.624668592163159,"source":"樂","target":"實"},{"weight":0.7375989431307791,"source":"言","target":"王"},{"weight":1.749199854809259,"source":"言","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.3437347467010947,"source":"言","target":"義"},{"weight":1.9315214116032138,"source":"實","target":"義"},{"weight":1.9315214116032138,"source":"實","target":"文"},{"weight":2.336986519711378,"source":"實","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.1546649629174235,"source":